<title>USA: Gymboree names White president.</title>
<headline>Gymboree names White president.</headline>
<dateline>BURLINGAME, Calif. 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gymboree Corp said Nancy Pedot will resign as president, chief executive officer and director of the company, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Gary White, Gymboree's Chief Operating Officer, was named her successor and will also join the board of directors.</p>
<p>The company said for its fourth quarter ended February 2, 1997, Gymboree expects to report net earnings, after charges for discontinuance of its catalog operation, within the range of analyst expectations. The company said the consensus, according to analysts, was for Gymboree to report $0.39 a share for the quarter.</p>
</text>
